  "question": {
    "text": "The percentage hydrolysis of $0.15 \\mathrm{M}$ solution of ammonium acetate, $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{a}}$ for $\\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{COOH}$ is $1.8 \\times 10^{-5}$\r\n\r\nand $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{b}}$ for $\\mathrm{NH}_{3}$ is $1.8 \\times 10^{-5}$"
  },
